    "<h2><strong>了解面料</strong></h2>\n<p>现在，你可以为自己的沙发选择更多种颜色和材质的外套面料。<br />不妨了解一下它们有何不同：<strong><br /></strong></p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": {
    "traceId": "159a86b166e7404187a86ce63c242a7b"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "<h4><strong>▲ Tallmyra 塔米拉</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>以天然纤维制成的雪尼尔面料，透气性强，高档华贵，绒面丰满，手感柔软干爽，装饰性和舒适性的巧妙结合。</li>\n<li>\n<div>78%棉, 22%聚酯纤维</div>\n</li>\n</ul>",
    "pub-text"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/9b/54/9b54db6a47034255c2cdf860cea48141.gif",
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/9d/d3/9dd330b262ecf7c478b63a6592c1efd6.gif",
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/39/bd/39bdad49efede487cfa89bd5050d9576.gif"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/9b/54/9b54db6a47034255c2cdf860cea48141.gif",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
