   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "<h4><strong>▲ Djuparp 尤帕</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>高档平绒面料，高密度的绒毛带给你柔软而立体的手感；粘胶纤维在绒毛中的应用使得面料更加亲肤和滑爽。</li>\n<li>\n<div>62%聚酯纤维, 38%粘胶纤维/人造丝</div>\n</li>\n</ul>",
    "pub-text"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/d3/da/d3da60c4d4fde80c85f5617d632facb0.gif",
